t milk traps to slow your foes, and fling cookie cutters to dice up enemies. Armed with trusty kitchen utensils, slice, dice, and batter your way through hordes of fiends. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/4f3cd870aeecbf02d02d8f0d62e6e213.webp?t=1746540402\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9f7da91a996e28bae8519e0f56bb57d1.poster.avif?t=1746540402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9f7da91a996e28bae8519e0f56bb57d1.webm?t=1746540402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/9f7da91a996e28bae8519e0f56bb57d1.mp4?t=1746540402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Witch of the Candy Woods has returned \u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and she\u2019s seeking revenge! Once peaceful lands are now overrun by baked beasts, from gingerbread zombies to savage animal crackers, wreaking havoc wherever they go. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/ea0f5809dae78401a63af58b188b7024.webp?t=1746540402\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/0ba7b4c818a0a9606432520e03935494.poster.avif?t=1746540402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932380/extras/0ba7b4c818a0a9606432520e03935494.webm?t=1746540402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src